⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of The Thermians
node GQT · GQT · ⟦The Thermians:GQT:7dd359⟧

WHO   — The Thermians — the believers · the ultimate fans
WHAT  — The film's heart-species: the ultimate fans, whose literal, guileless belief is both the joke and the grace of the movie.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the movie's love for fandom needs a people who embody it — total, sincere, unembarrassed devotion.
HOW   — By being unable to imagine fiction, and so loving the heroes of a TV show enough to make them, and the ship, real.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  We are the fans taken to the limit: we could not tell it was a story, so we believed all the way — and built it true.

